OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a chilly start with
OL,6,Fa few fog patches soon clearing.
OL,7,FOtherwise it will be dry with bright
OL,8,For sunny spells by day.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FClouding over through the
OL,11,Fevening with outbreaks of rain and
OL,12,Ffreshening south to southeast winds.
OL,13,FDrier overnight as winds ease but
OL,14,Fremaining dull and overcast.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FIt will be cloudy throughout
OL,17,Fthe day with the odd spot of light
OL,18,Fdrizzle at times. Freshening winds
OL,19,Fdeveloping later as well as some
OL,20,Fheavier outbreaks of rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
